## Retraining

The model only knows the labels above. Retrain when labels change or accuracy drifts:
re-open the CLM Forge project for task `{{ task.name }}`, add misclassified production states
(e.g. from the shadow log) as `user` rows in the dataset, and run training + evaluation again;
the new package keeps the same import and API. Bump the wheel version in your dependency pin.

